# Editions: the signed release streams a server can follow. publish-delivery.sh bakes this table into the delivered
# install.sh and lists it in SHA256SUMS, so the release signature covers it. One edition per line, fields split by spaces:
#   name  image_repo (images are <image_repo>/malkkeum-api and -web)  signer_repo (owner/repo whose release.yml signs)
#   delivery_raw (raw URL of the public delivery repo)  domains (the servers that may switch to it; * = any, never offered)
# A server with no EDITION in .env follows the dahae row through its own .env values, exactly as before editions existed.
dahae ghcr.io/ericwijesinghe EricWijesinghe/Dahae https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EricWijesinghe/Dahae-install *
